# Kawa no Nushi Tsuri 2 (SFC, Japan) - single-byte text table (DRAFT)
# Byte b (01-CB) draws font glyph index (b-1)+0x2C0.  Font ROM base 0x30000.
# Derived visually from the rendered font sheet; verify the items marked '?' below.
# Not in table: 00 = end of string, CC = line break (inferred), CD-DF = control codes (handler at $82:871E),
#               E0-EF xx = two-byte kanji glyph, glyph index = ((b&0F)<<8)|xx
#               0F, 10 = small kana (unconfirmed), AF = 々? (unconfirmed), B1-B7 = cm, m, U, L, M, H, ォ (unconfirmed)
